  "body": "Quality brick and tile living, fantastic all-season entertaining and a location that ticks all the boxes!\r\nTucked away in a peaceful cul-de-sac with Barwick Reserve directly opposite, 24 Barwick Place offers space, privacy and convenience. Built in 2013, this quality brick and tile home boasts a generous 203sqm floor area on a 634sqm freehold section, perfect for families, downsizers or those seeking low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for comfort and practicality, the home offers easy living across one main level, with a separate formal lounge and spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The designer kitchen features composite stone benchtops, creating a welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining.\r\nStep outside to the fantastic undercover outdoor entertaining area, ideal for year-round BBQs, family gatherings or simply relaxing. \r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n*\t634sqm freehold section and 203sqm home\r\n*\tFour spacious bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n*\tExtra-large master bedroom with ensuite\r\n*\tSeparate lounge plus open-plan family living\r\n*\tDesigner kitchen with stone benchtops\r\n*\tFantastic undercover entertaining for all seasons\r\n*\tFully fenced, private and easy-care grounds\r\n*\tDouble internal-access garage\r\n*\tHRV system and quality finishes\r\n*\tDurable, low-maintenance brick and tile construction\r\n*\tBarwick Reserve directly opposite\r\n*\t\r\nLocation, lifestyle and convenience!\r\nEnjoy being close to Whangaparaoa Plaza, schools, supermarkets, cafés, medical facilities and everyday amenities. Stanmore Bay Leisure Centre and a variety of beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches are just minutes away.\r\nWith O Mahurangi - Penlink well underway, future commuting to the North Shore and Auckland City is set to become even more convenient.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a family wanting room to grow or looking to downsize without compromising on space, 24 Barwick Place offers the perfect balance of comfort, quality and easy living.\r\n\r\nLow-maintenance living, generous space and year-round entertaining - this home ticks the boxes!\r\nDownload documents here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/9I24",
